Barney Luttbeg (btluttbeg@ucdavis.edu) wrote:
: I have often seen people post that they have genocided L's (or some other
: letter).  When I have had the chance to use a scroll of genocide it will
: not accept my choice when I enter just a letter.  So, I have ended up
: naming a specific monster.  Is there a way to genocide a letter (referring
: to many monsters)?  Or are people just abbreviating?
: Barney 

A scroll of genocide will let you genocide one type of creature.  If you find
a *blessed* scroll of genocide you can take all the creatures of a letter you
choose.  This is is good reason for identifying scrolls before you use them,
and carrying around holy water.

Scott Wilkins

